  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qRjo0h9.png\" width=\"822\" height=\"295\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">适用于 Fabric 的现代化 Hypixel 风格幸运方块。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组仅支持服务端，这意味着玩家在游玩包含幸运方块的服务器时无需安装该模组。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FYkDhCe.png\" width=\"249\" height=\"125\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ebiQRVe.gif\" width=\"253\" height=\"132\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wcH30VD.gif\" width=\"200\" height=\"146\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zeAnXBy.gif\" width=\"107\" height=\"101\"></p>\n<p>与 Apex Hosting 合作，点击下方横幅即可获取服务器：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.apexminecrafthosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3548\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cardboardpowered.org/assets/apex-hosting-mobile.webp\" width=\"539\" height=\"91\"></a></p>",
